{"id": "59073", "title": "迷恋古希腊", "author": "夜辰", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 14, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/59/59073.htm", "intro": "属性分类：古代／异国背景／一般言情／未定\r\n关键字：穿越时空 　 　其他 \r\n\r\n她～原是一个历史高材生，却得了严重幻听，不停有人在她耳边念她、怨她、咒她，她是得了几辈子的楣阿！\r\n别人都是回到古代，认识又温柔多金的东方帅哥。\r\n但她，却跑到西元前古希腊，原以为上天还算对自己眷顾，让自己目睹风靡西方世界的亚历山大父亲-腓力二世。\r\n但是事情好像不照著自己认知的历史认知进行，天啊！她该遵从历史学者的职业道德还是自私的情感", "base": "files/article/html/59/59073", "chapters": [{"title": "1-10", "file": "8552439.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-20", "file": "8552440.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-30", "file": "8552441.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-40", "file": "8552446.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-50", "file": "8552450.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51-60", "file": "8552452.html", "available": false}, {"title": "61-64", "file": "8552454.html", "available": false}, {"title": "1-10", "file": "8552458.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-20", "file": "8552461.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-30", "file": "8552463.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-40", "file": "8552465.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-50", "file": "8552468.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51-60", "file": "8552469.html", "available": false}, {"title": "61-65完结", "file": "8552470.html", "available": false}]}